><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/5068fa03a3bbdc46df1fdb2cfe256f4b.poster.avif?t=1745755003\" width=584 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/5068fa03a3bbdc46df1fdb2cfe256f4b.webm?t=1745755003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/5068fa03a3bbdc46df1fdb2cfe256f4b.mp4?t=1745755003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although the space is limited, the blocks are made up of straight lines and right angles, allowing you to interlock them, balance, and stack them as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rotate the Watermelon!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/feb6409974b05fec3960edbbbdfbe394.poster.avif?t=1745755003\" width=584 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/feb6409974b05fec3960edbbbdfbe394.webm?t=1745755003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/feb6409974b05fec3960edbbbdfbe394.mp4?t=1745755003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can rotate the watermelon to move the blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/775e5e1987b681ebe301f28538605e9b.poster.avif?t=1745755003\" width=584 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/775e5e1987b681ebe301f28538605e9b.webm?t=1745755003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/775e5e1987b681ebe301f28538605e9b.mp4?t=1745755003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use this to create gaps between blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/c7d01b9865618c5786d76b15e108953f.poster.avif?t=1745755003\" width=584 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/c7d01b9865618c5786d76b15e108953f.webm?t=1745755003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/c7d01b9865618c5786d76b15e108953f.mp4?t=1745755003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also merge the blocks inside the watermelon (though it's not easy!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/2372b58e7c217388cffa817329f934b2.poster.avif?t=1745755003\" width=584 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/2372b58e7c217388cffa817329f934b2.webm?t=1745755003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/2372b58e7c217388cffa817329f934b2.mp4?t=1745755003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, as you might accidentally drop more blocks 